  "title": "About Us - The Largest Online Therapy Provider | BetterHelp",
  "navigation_error": null,
  "visible_text_excerpt": "Skip to Main Content Business About Advice FAQ Reviews Therapist jobs Contact Log in Get started About us About Careers Social impact Client outcomes Responsible AI Find yourself in therapy BetterHelp was founded in 2013 to remove the traditional barriers to therapy and make mental health care more accessible to everyone. Today, it is the world’s largest therapy service — providing professional, affordable, and tailored therapy in a convenient online format. BetterHelp’s network of more than 31,000 licensed therapists has helped over 5 million people worldwide take ownership of their mental health and work towards their personal goals. As the unmet need for mental health services continues to grow, BetterHelp is committed to expanding access to therapy globally. Our therapists BetterHelp offers access to licensed, trained, and experienced psychologists (PhD / PsyD), marriage and family therapists (LMFT), clinical social workers (LCSW / LMSW), and board licensed professional counselors (LPC). Use the Pause/Play rotation button to pause or start the rotating images. Get started Our latest reviews \"She’s the best!\" - Written about 13 hours ago for Amy Watts (LCSW) \"She’s very casual and comfortable. Makes it easy to talk.\" - Written about 12 hours ago for Lauren Meier (LCSW-C) \"Absolutely amazing individual. Her empathy and understanding of just how my brain operates is really special. Easy to talk to. I feel parts of me beginning to heal.\" - Written about 11 hours ago for Megumi Britt (LCSW) See more reviews Our social impact $ 6 5 , 6 9 7 , 9 2 4 5 Given in discounts and financial aid to cover therapy costs for low-income individuals 1 0 6 , 2 0 1 2 Free months of therapy donated to communities in need We partner with 100+ impactful non-profit organizations to donate free therapy to under-resourced communities and break down barriers to accessing therapy. See more Our team We are passionate and compassionate professionals, driven by the mission of helping more people live a better and happier life every day. We are growing fast and always looking for new talent. If you love people and like challenges - come and join us! Team Photos Slide 1 of 8 Join our team If you are in a crisis or any other person may be in danger - don't use this site. These resources can provide you with immediate help. Home Business About FAQ Reviews Advice Careers Find a Therapist Online Therapy Contact For Therapists AARP Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy Health Data Do Not Sell My Information Web Accessibility © 2026 BetterHelp [redacted-secret] We process personally identifiable and personal health information to conduct our business, as described in our Privacy Policy. Some data processing and sharing is required for our business to function. By clicking \"I agree\" we may share PII with third party advertising partners to deliver relevant ads or analytics partners to improve our services. To learn more or to opt-out go to \"Sharing settings\". Sharing settings I agree",
